{
  "name": "Find underpriced Vinted deals with price history, AI red-flag checks and Discord alerts",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "1e01456b-5923-4e26-9be9-de5021449256",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -760,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 600,
        "height": 1004,
        "content": "## Find underpriced Vinted deals with AI checks and Discord alerts\n\nFor resellers and bargain-hunters who want only the Vinted listings that are genuinely cheap, not every new one.\n\n### How it works\n1. Every 15 minutes, reads your active searches from Google Sheets and calls Apify's Vinted scraper in delta mode: only new or price-dropped listings, never billed twice.\n2. Logs every listing to a History tab, then computes each search's 14-day median price and a deal score.\n3. An optional OpenAI check drops fakes, replicas, damaged or mis-sized listings.\n4. 30%+ below median: instant Discord alert with photo. 10-29% below: queued for one 8am digest.\n5. Three failed or empty runs in a row: one Discord warning, and the row is marked in the Sheet.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create an Apify API token, then a Header Auth credential (`Authorization` / `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`) on \"Search Vinted (delta mode)\".\n2. Create a Google Sheet with tabs `Searches` (searchInput, country, maxPrice, conditions, brands, discordWebhook, active, failCount, status), `History` and `Digest` (headers in the template description). Select it on every Google Sheets node.\n3. Paste a Discord channel webhook URL into each search row.\n4. Optional: add an OpenAI credential to enable the red-flag check.\n5. Activate the workflow.\n\n### Customization\nChange the HOT/GOOD thresholds in \"Route by deal score\", or turn on `includeDetails` for seller ratings.\n\nCost: about $0.0023 per listing found with the [Vinted Scraper](https://apify.com/accountable_eel/vinted-listing-lookup); quiet runs cost only the $0.00005 start fee. Made by the actor's author."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
